\newlabel{fig:coupling_comparison}{{1}{3}{Comparison of three coupling strategies for flow matching: Independent-CFM, Entropic-CFM, and OT-CFM. Each panel shows sample trajectories (red) from the source distribution (8 Gaussians, black) to the target distribution (Moons, blue). OT-CFM produces shorter, straighter trajectories by minimizing transport cost, while Independent-CFM yields crossing paths}{figure.caption.2}{}}
