\newlabel{fig:energy_functions}{{2}{4}{Left: the energy function $J(x)$ selecting three of the eight Gaussian modes (low values indicate preferred regions). Right: the corresponding exponentially weighted density $e^{-J(x)}$, proportional to the guided target $p'(x) \propto p_1(x)\,e^{-J(x)}$, with the three target modes clearly localized}{figure.caption.3}{}}
