\newlabel{fig:phase_diagrams}{{5}{5}{Phase diagrams for MC guidance across coupling regularization strengths (columns, from independent coupling to exact-OT) and the stabilization parameter $\epsilon $ (rows, from 0.03 to 0.2). Stronger coupling (right columns) consistently increases the energy distance and off-manifold rate, indicating that the independence assumption of MC guidance breaks down under tight couplings}{figure.caption.7}{}}
